_close_elements 1.0, 2.0, 3.0], 0.5","doi":"10.7554/elife.37268.036","arxiv_id":null,"title":null},{"raw_text":"A New Conjecture: Any Whole Number Greater than 3 has the Equal Distance from Two Prime Numbers\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMohammadrezaBarghi\n\t\t\n\t\t10.21275/sr231006065849\n\t\n\t\n\t\tInternational Journal of Science and Research (IJSR)\n\t\tIJSR\n\t\t2319-7064\n\t\t\n\t\t\t12\n\t\t\t10\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t1.0, 2.8, 3.0, 4.0, 5.0, 2.0], 0.3\n\t\t\tInternational Journal of Science and Research\n\t\t\n\t\n\t) True","doi":"10.21275/sr231006065849","arxiv_id":null,"title":"A New Conjecture: Any Whole Number Greater than 3 has the Equal Distance from Two Prime Numbers"},{"raw_text":"Make sure you understand the task\n\t\t\n\t\t\t**Understand\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t**Clarify","doi":null,"arxiv_id":null,"title":null},{"raw_text":"Interesting approach, but accompanying manuscript not provided, discussion a bit narrow &amp; method potentially not most efficient way\n\t\t\n\t\t\t**Algorithm\n\t\t\n\t\t10.5194/esurf-2018-36-rc1\n\t\n\t\n\t\tMethod Selection**: Decide on the most efficient way\n\t\t\n\t\t\tCopernicus GmbH","doi":"10.5194/esurf-2018-36-rc1","arxiv_id":null,"title":"Interesting approach, but accompanying manuscript not provided, discussion a bit narrow &amp; method potentially not most efficient way"},{"raw_text":"**Pseudocode\n\t\t\n\t\tCreation**: Write down the steps you will follow in pseudocode","doi":null,"arxiv_id":null,"title":null},{"raw_text":"Figure 4: An example of the prompt used to generate the refactored code.\n\t\t10.7717/peerj-cs.2730/fig-4\n\t\n\t\n\t\tAgentCoder: Programmer Prompt Figure\n\t\t\n\t\t\t6\n\t\t\tnull\n\t\t\tPeerJ\n\t\t\n\t\n\tAgentCoder programmer prompt example","doi":"10.7717/peerj-cs.2730/fig-4","arxiv_id":null,"title":"Figure 4: An example of the prompt used to generate the refactored code."}],"layout_json":null,"tei_xml":"<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<TEI xml:space=\"preserve\" xmlns=\"http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0\" \n